Truk itu ada ke depo selama ini.

432
00:33:57,701 --> 00:34:00,902
Kami bawa mobil Nick ke bar dan lupa.

433
00:34:06,610 --> 00:34:08,610
Hei.

434
00:34:09,045 --> 00:34:10,110
Kau baik-baik saja?

435
