Cuma urusan rumah sakit.

437
00:34:14,618 --> 00:34:15,884
Maaf.

438
00:34:15,953 --> 00:34:16,953
Hei.

439
00:34:19,489 --> 00:34:21,121
Kita semua mendoakannya.

440
00:34:21,190 --> 00:34:22,591
Terima kasih, saudara.

441
00:34:22,660 --> 00:34:23,660
Kuhargai itu.

442
00:34:25,729 --> 00:34:27,294
Tambah lagi, robot manis.

443
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:31,298
Kalian punya antrean kerja?

444
00:34:32,468 --> 00:34:34,869
Kudengar Brightland akan
mendatangkan beberapa orang.

445
00:34:34,939 --> 00:34:37,906
Tapi kebanyakan mencari teknisi
yang mau mengasuh robot mereka.

446
00:34:37,975 --> 00:34:40,609
Hal sama di Artwood & Sons.

447
00:34:40,678 --> 00:34:44,144
Bayar satu penggerutu,
beli lima bot, tertebak.

448
00:34:45,248 --> 00:34:47,147
Kini aku tahu perasaan dinosaurus.

449
00:34:47,551 --> 00:34:48,750
Persetan itu.

450
00:34:48,819 --> 00:34:50,317
Mereka tersapu komet.

451
00:34:50,386 --> 00:34:51,386


